{"id":"vod_sn_38808","vodId":"38808","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"大图书馆的牧羊人","name_cn":"大图书馆的牧羊人","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f3999359cbf6b80b80caeb54268883cc.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立汐美学园之中，这里汇聚着在各种方面有着杰出表现的孩子们，他们的身上，承载着整个城市的荣耀和希望。学园之中有着“睿智之城”美名的图书馆格外醒目，然而，在图书馆最深处的阅览室中，大幕正在徐徐的拉开。　　有着旺盛求知欲的笕京太郎（间岛淳司 配音）、乐观开朗积极努力的白崎绪美（米泽圆 配音）、稳重认真深受信赖的樱庭玉藻（齐藤佑圭 配音）、外冷内热的御园千莉（山本希望 配音）、温柔善良的铃木佳奈（仙台绘里 配音）和大大咧咧的小太刀凪（种崎敦美 配音），六名互不相识的少年少女在冥冥之中汇聚在此处，即将展开他们波澜壮阔的冒险。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/huDTPeewnc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1rENXZWZG11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WaEux5N4z81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fVZGWNcF2e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uPXkuL6nqy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fPbsaFqxU41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u81U8uCWjG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PUw38KNaYP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fJgAUeX7WN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9ajmAqzu6V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QNXjM2iLt41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WgMqSa4C9b1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.109Z"}